<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body class="site-main">
<%- include('../../partials/topbar') %>
<%- include('../../partials/nav-main') %>
<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/compliance">Compliance</a> / Privacy Policy</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
      <div style="background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:3rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
        <p style="color:var(--gray);font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:2rem">Last updated: January 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Greenwood High School, Warangal</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">When you use our website (ghs.ac.in), we may collect: your name, phone number, and email address when you submit an admission enquiry or contact form; browser type and IP address for security purposes; cookies for session management and analytics.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">We use collected information to respond to your enquiries, process admission applications, send important school communications, and improve our website. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">3. Cookies</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">Our website uses session cookies necessary for website functionality. We may use analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our site. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not work correctly.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">Admission enquiry data is retained for the duration of the academic year and archived thereafter. Contact form submissions are retained for 12 months. You may request deletion of your data by emailing us.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">Our website uses Google Fonts and Font Awesome (loaded from CDN) and may use Google Maps embeds. These services have their own privacy policies. We do not share personal data with these providers.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">6. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8">Our website is not intended for direct use by children under 18. All enquiries and data submissions are expected to be made by parents or guardians. We are committed to protecting the privacy of all students enrolled in our schools.</p>

        <h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">7. Contact for Privacy Concerns</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--gray);line-height:1.8">For any privacy-related concerns, data access requests, or deletion requests, contact us at <a href="mailto:office@ghs.ac.in" style="color:var(--green)">office@ghs.ac.in</a> or via our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--green)">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../../partials/footer-main') %>
<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
